    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Show that\n$${}^{2n}P_{n+1}=2n\\times{}^{2n-1}P_n.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2n\\times{}^{2n-1}P_n=\\dfrac{(2n)!}{(n-1)!}={}^{2n}P_{n+1}$.",
      "worked": "For positive integers $n$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{LHS}&=\\frac{(2n)!}{(2n-n-1)!}\\\\&=\\frac{(2n)!}{(n-1)!}.\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{RHS}&=\\frac{2n\\times(2n-1)!}{(2n-1-n)!}\\\\&=\\frac{2n\\times(2n-1)!}{(n-1)!}\\\\&=\\frac{(2n)!}{(n-1)!}\\\\&=\\mathrm{LHS}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 39
  },
